  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c383a297-21a4-4c9b-98e3-c554502ab69d"],
 " and a factor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], 
