  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f0454adb-11b7-424f-aa0d-01a5da9eb466"],
 " of the Koszul sign of bringing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["u", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00d714d4-61b1-4b6e-bf19-bc669e7c5d40"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], 
